<p>Armaan nikaalu , parwan chadaalu<br />
tehro ali akber tumhe dulha to banaalu</p>

<p>Phal barchi ka khaaye hue sote ho zamee'n par<br />
Ae laal kaleje ko mai kis tarha sambhaalu</p>

<p>shaayad yuhi'n tham jaaye lahu zaqme jigar ka <br />
utho ali akber mai kaleje se nikaalu</p>

<p>Ae laal tere byaah ka zainab ko tha armaa'n <br />
In qoo'n bhare haato me mai mehndi to lagaalu</p>

<p>Yu ghar se mere laal ko le jaaye'n na hazrat<br />
Saaya karei'n aanchal ka mai behno ko bulaalu</p>

<p>Tehraao janaza mujhe hasrat to na reh jaaye<br />
armaan bhare laal ka armaan nikaalu</p>

<p>pehnake zara dekh lu poshak shahani<br />
taboot pa phoolo ka mai sehra to chadhaalu</p>

<p>Shoukat pa zara rehm kar ae mout taharja<br />
aankho se mazaare shahe mazloom lagaalu<br />
</p>